WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.690
In the city of Puri, huge wooden chariots
roll out of a temple once a year.

2
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:10.190
Vast crowds take hold of the ropes
and pull them through the streets.

3
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.130
Elsewhere, families stay awake and
wait for midnight to celebrate a birth.

4
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:19.580
And in another festival, clay figures are
carried in procession and lowered into

5
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:21.030
the water.

6
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.070
Why wait for midnight, or pull
a chariot through the streets?

7
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.570
In this mission, you'll meet the stories
and customs of several festivals.

8
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:32.240
Then you'll ask who keeps which festival,

9
00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:36.420
and weigh up whether festivals
divide Hindus or bring them together.

10
00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:40.360
Your mission: find out the story
behind each of these festivals.
